{'symbol': 'SIVB', 'date': '2022-09-21 19:01:00', 'title': "SVB'S UK BUSINESS BECOMES SUBSIDIARY BANK, REFLECTING STRONG GROWTH", 'text': 'COMPANY NAMES ERIN PLATTS CEO OF SILICON VALLEY BANK UK AND APPOINTS NEW BOARD OF DIRECTORS LONDON , SEPT. 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SVB FINANCIAL GROUP (SVB) (NASDAQ: SIVB), THE FINANCIAL PARTNER OF THE INNOVATION ECONOMY AND PARENT OF SILICON VALLEY BANK, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS UK BRANCH HAS BECOME A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF SILICON VALLEY BANK, DUE TO SIGNIFICANT GROWTH OF THE BUSINESS.'}